<a class="text-villa-gold hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm" href="/blog.html"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg> Back to Diary</a>
